"legal.export_title" = "Access, export and deletion";
"legal.export_body" = "You can request a machine-readable JSON export from Account Security. It includes your account, profile, relocation plan, content, settings, interactions, reports you submitted, and messages you authored. APNs tokens, storage paths, provider asset IDs, and other operational secrets are not included.";
"legal.retention_title" = "Retention";
"legal.retention_body" = "When account deletion completes, account-owned profile, plan, content, device registrations, settings, and media metadata are removed. Open moderation reports remain while open. Resolved or dismissed reports and dependent moderation audit records are retained for up to 12 months after review, then purged. Active group bans remain while active. Short-lived notification signals expire after 24 hours and are purged hourly; unattached media follows state-specific cleanup windows and pending-review media is retained until review.";
